{"id": "70526", "title": "当王子撞上王子", "author": "堂桂花", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 16, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70526/70526s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70526.htm", "intro": "【猪老大祈安之的故事】\n    属性分类：现代／都市生活\n    奇耻大辱啊！\n    被一个男人撞倒，并被突然袭击了「那个部位」，\n    这难道不该被牢记一辈子吗？\n    三岁的小人儿决定要永远牢记著这个深仇大恨！\n    而随著认识的时间越长，「仇恨」就如滚雪球般越积越多，\n    直到那场婚礼，终于完全的崩裂开来。\n    「你是跟我走，还是就在这里谈？」\n    王子高傲的问另一位王子，\n    我们的剧本里没有公主，也不应该出现灰姑娘。\n    如果有，那全部！立即！统统！给我滚出去！", "base": "files/article/html/70/70526", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10997457.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10997458.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10997459.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10997460.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10997461.html", "available": true}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10997462.html", "available": true}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10997463.html", "available": true}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10997464.html", "available": true}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10997465.html", "available": true}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10997466.html", "available": true}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "10997467.html", "available": true}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "10997468.html", "available": true}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "10997469.html", "available": true}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "10997470.html", "available": true}, {"title": "71-74", "file": "10997471.html", "available": true}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10997472.html", "available": true}]}